  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam is set to enhance the PARCEL project by expanding its resources to accommodate various languages. Furthermore, Oxfam will conduct training sessions aimed at empowering humanitarian actors to bolster their proficiency in humanitarian logistics, thereby enhancing their ability to effectively support humanitarian endeavours.</narrative>
  </description>
